Due to the large number of requests for hints to the shareware version
of Igor: Objective Uikokahonia, here are several hints to get you started.

1) Pick up the note at the far left side of the waterfall.
2) Inside the faculty building, goto the physics classroom and look in the
   garbage can.
3) Get the folder from the crying girl, and use it with Philips folder.
4) Look inside philips folder for the combination to his locker.

There are approximately another 10 things to do inside the shareware version.

In addition, even though the game says there is nothing left to do, you will
be able to leave the buildings to see new animations, as well as visit
a new building due to the results of whats in the animation.

